// iWADemo local configuration template.
//
// 1. Copy this file to `Local.xcconfig` (gitignored).
// 2. Paste your real values below.
// 3. In Xcode: Select the iWADemo project → iWADemo target →
//    "Info" tab → set the Debug/Release configuration's "Based On" to Local.xcconfig.
//    Or set these directly as environment variables in the Run scheme:
//    Product → Scheme → Edit Scheme → Run → Arguments → Environment Variables.
//
// WalletAdapterServiceConfiguration.fromEnvironment() reads these names. The
// resolution order is: SOLANA_RPC_URL → HELIUS_RPC_URL → public mainnet default.

// SOLANA_CLUSTER = mainnet-beta
// SOLANA_RPC_URL =
// HELIUS_RPC_URL = https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=<your-helius-key>
// JUP_API_URL = https://api.jup.ag
// JUP_API_KEY =
